#: otterwiki/templates/tools/housekeeping_gitgc.html:3
msgid ""
"Every change made via the wiki is stored as a loose object in the git "
"repository. Over time many loose objects can slow down saving pages. Git "
"Garbage Collection packs them and removes unreachable objects by running "
"<code>git gc</code>."
msgstr ""
"通过 Wiki 进行的每次更改都会以松散对象的形式存储在 git 仓库中。随着时间推移，大量松散对象会拖慢页面保存速度。Git 垃圾回收会运行 "
"<code>git gc</code>，将它们打包并删除不可达的对象。"

